      "content": "Please run SAMBAR on our 120 bladder tumors to get pathway mutation scores and subtypes with 2 to 4 clusters. I have the gene-length file, the cancer-gene list and a GMT file. I'm not sure whether the tumor matrix the sequencing core put in our folder is the somatic mutation table or the RNA-seq expression table."
